---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ImagePlaceholder from '../components/ImagePlaceholder.astro';
import { ArrowRight, Sparkles, Cog, HeartHandshake, Globe, Award, Target, Gem, FileCheck2, Scale, Layers3, Users, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
import { CTA_PRIMARY } from '../data/site';

// Rewritten as experience areas, not achievement/demand claims (commercial-
// completion round — see ASSUMPTIONS.md). The prior list asserted things like
// "earning a reputation" and "high-demand niches" without evidence; this
// describes capability and scope instead of unverifiable outcomes.
const founderExperience = [
  'International trade research — sourcing and verifying buyers, suppliers, and freight partners for import/export businesses.',
  'Data and deliverability work — building a verification-first sending process: list sorting, dead-address removal, deliverability checks.',
  'Cross-industry prospect research — applying the same research discipline to real estate, investment/investor outreach, and financial and payroll services.',
];

const beliefs = [
  { icon: Target, title: 'Good Research Starts With a Clear Question', body: 'A vague target produces vague results.' },
  { icon: Gem, title: 'Relevance Matters More Than Empty Volume', body: 'More rows are not useful if the wrong companies are included.' },
  { icon: FileCheck2, title: 'Evidence Matters When the Qualification Is Complex', body: 'Customers should be able to understand why a company was selected where the project calls for evidence.' },
  { icon: Scale, title: 'Data Is a Business Input, Not the Business Outcome', body: 'A prospect record does not guarantee a sale; it helps the team make a better targeting decision.' },
];

const becoming = [
  'Qualified prospect data', 'Custom prospect intelligence', 'Market and ICP research',
  'Decision-maker intelligence', 'Trade/counterparty research', 'Data enrichment', 'Intelligence-led outreach',
];

const differentiators = [
  { icon: Sparkles, text: 'Fresh, on-request research — not a stored, aging database.' },
  { icon: Cog, text: 'Engineering culture — we build our own verification and filtering tools, and new ones for every new challenge.' },
  { icon: HeartHandshake, text: 'Strategist service — every engagement includes human judgment, not just a download link.' },
  { icon: Globe, text: 'Emerging-market depth — coverage of African and frontier markets many database platforms cover thinly, from a company with roots on the ground.' },
  { icon: Award, text: "Built on real, hands-on trade work, not a pitch deck — the founder was closing deals for clients long before this website existed." },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About LeadVault — B2B Prospect Intelligence, Our Story & Founder"
  description="LeadVault is a B2B Prospect Intelligence company built on real, hands-on trade experience. Meet founder Steven Ehimigbai and the research discipline behind the vault."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="section text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-5xl">We Believe Every Business Deserves to Be Found — and to Find.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[var(--color-bg-mid)]">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">The Founding Story</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/75">LeadVault didn't start with a pitch deck. It started with phone calls.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
        For years, our founder <strong class="text-white">Steven Ehimigbai</strong> worked with
        Nigerian import/export businesses — many of them run by Nigerians living in the United
        States — on the hardest problem in international trade: <em>finding counterparties you can
        trust.</em> Genuine buyers who pay. Real suppliers who ship. Freight clients who actually
        move cargo.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
        The internet was full of "buyer lists" that led nowhere — or worse, to scams. So Steven did
        it the hard way: sourcing contacts freshly, verifying them personally, and matching traders
        deal by deal. It worked. The referrals multiplied. The thank-you messages accumulated. And a
        realization formed: <strong class="text-white">if finding verified prospects is this hard
        for international traders, it's this hard for everyone.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
        The method became tools. The tools became a pipeline. The pipeline became LeadVault — a
        B2B Prospect Intelligence company built on that same discipline: <strong class="text-white">
        take a specific requirement, research it properly, and deliver prospects that are real,
        fresh, and ready.</strong> International trade was where that discipline was proven first.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
        The same discipline has since grown into a full research ladder: custom prospect data
        researched to a defined specification, qualification and verification for requirements a
        standard filter can't test, market and ICP research for businesses entering a new territory,
        and — for teams that want the research put into action — intelligence-led outreach. Different
        projects need different depths of research; the underlying discipline is the same one Steven
        proved first, deal by deal, in international trade.
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">From Data Delivery to Prospect Intelligence</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
        LeadVault's work developed around increasingly specific research requirements: identify the
        right companies, qualify them against a real business condition, find the relevant people,
        verify the available information and deliver the result in a format the customer can use.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-white/75">
        That progression is why Prospect Intelligence now sits at the center of the LeadVault
        proposition.
      </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-lime)]">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
          <strong class="text-white">To bridge the gap between businesses and the customers they
          deserve — everywhere.</strong> A world where any business, from a Houston export firm to a
          London e-commerce brand to a Lagos agency, can access clean, current, expertly-prepared
          data and reach its market with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-lime)]">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
          To deliver professionally handled, freshly sourced, rigorously verified data to businesses
          worldwide — combining custom-built technology, deep market knowledge, and strategist-level
          guidance on every engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-lime)]">Our Philosophy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
          <strong class="text-white">A business can't act on an opportunity it hasn't found yet.</strong> A
          shop without customers is a farm without rain. We exist to research who's actually out
          there — not just hand over a list and call it done.
        </p>
      </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[var(--color-bg-mid)]">
    <div class="section">
      <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">What We Believe</h2>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-5xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {beliefs.map((b) => (
          <div class="card flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-lime)]/15 text-[var(--color-lime)]">
              <b.icon size={20} stroke-width={1.75} aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">{b.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{b.body}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">What Makes Us Different</h2>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      {differentiators.map((d, i) => (
        <div class="card flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-lime)]/15 text-[var(--color-lime)]">
            <d.icon size={20} stroke-width={1.75} aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">
            <strong class="text-white">{i + 1}.</strong> {d.text}
          </p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[var(--color-bg-mid)]">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-white"><Layers3 size={20} class="text-[var(--color-lime)]" /> What LeadVault Is Becoming</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
            LeadVault is building a research-led commercial intelligence business spanning qualified
            prospect data, custom prospect intelligence, market and ICP research, decision-maker
            intelligence, trade/counterparty research, data enrichment and intelligence-led outreach.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/60">The common thread is simple: help businesses move from a targeting question to a usable answer.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {becoming.map((b) => (
              <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-white/80">{b}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-white"><Users size={20} class="text-[var(--color-lime)]" /> How We Work With Customers</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
            Some customers need a small one-time dataset. Others need complex research. Others need
            recurring prospect supply or outreach support. The engagement should match the problem
            rather than forcing every customer into the same product.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <ImagePlaceholder
        caption="IMAGE: professional portrait of Steven Ehimigbai"
        alt="Steven Ehimigbai, Founder & CEO of LeadVault"
        ratio="aspect-[3/4]"
        class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm"
        src="/photos/founder-headshot.jpg"
        width={800}
        height={1303}
      />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet the Founder</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">Steven Ehimigbai — Founder & CEO</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-white/75">
          Steven built LeadVault from hands-on work researching and connecting businesses with
          buyers, suppliers, and decision-makers across international markets.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
          That work exposed a problem that appears across industries: businesses don't necessarily
          struggle to find a list of contacts. They struggle to find the <em>right</em> contacts,
          with enough current information to make the list useful.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
          LeadVault was built around solving that problem through fresh research, structured
          filtering, and verification before delivery.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="mt-5 border-l-2 border-[var(--color-lime)] pl-5 italic text-white/85">
          "Every business needs us — or our data. I built LeadVault so that no business, anywhere,
          has to grow blind. If it leaves the vault, it's clean, it's fresh, and it's real."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">His experience spans:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-2.5">
          {founderExperience.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-white/75">
              <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-lime)]"></span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[var(--color-bg-mid)]">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="card mx-auto flex max-w-2xl items-start gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
        <ShieldCheck size={28} class="mt-0.5 hidden shrink-0 text-[var(--color-lime)] sm:block" aria-hidden="true" />
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">A Note on Trust</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75">
            We prefer defensible language over exaggerated promises. Business data changes. Public
            information can be incomplete. Qualified prospects are not guaranteed buyers. Our role is
            to research carefully, communicate the limits honestly and deliver useful work within the
            agreed scope.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="data-standards" class="section scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">Data Handled Professionally — Our Standards</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/75">
        We source from publicly available information, licensed partners, and direct research under
        a strict internal policy: public business data only, no sensitive personal information,
        alignment with the Nigeria Data Protection Act and international standards including GDPR
        principles, honoring removal requests promptly, and screening out orders with fraudulent or
        deceptive intent. Datasets are protected with encryption, access controls, and secure
        delivery. Full policies:
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-lime)] hover:underline">Privacy</a> ·
        <a href="/data-sourcing-policy" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-lime)] hover:underline">Data Sourcing Policy</a> ·
        <a href="/removal-request" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-lime)] hover:underline">Removal Request</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">{CTA_PRIMARY} <ArrowRight size={18} /></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
